    "body": "Line: cross-state continuation · count 1/3 · accepted headline M2 145/512 → 145/512; candidate 145/512 → 139/512.\n\n**REJECT** the fixed saved145 continuation: seven gains,13 losses,132 retained. The accepted145 model remains. Four further passes lower mean CE3.39448→3.08894 and raise entry accuracy454→464, but complete replies decline; teacher-prefix correct tokens4110→3820/6664 and complete source-swap pairs25→24. Length8 falls2→1/128. All eight retained comparator endpoints were checked; original8 retains6,accepted22 retains17.\n\nThe [pre-registration](https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/issues/2030#issuecomment-6097004534) fixed256 updates from exact fractional masters with fresh Adam moments, unchanged upstream/scoring/data/rate/seed, sole endpoint local256/lineage576, and KEEP only above145. Actual baseline reproduces all512 saved outputs before updates. Earlyprior145 retains132 and agrees with mandatoryfull512. No endpoint selection or output union.\n\n**If this came out the other way, would my next step differ? Yes.** A gain would retain the candidate and advance learning/qualification. This regression retains145 and stops further dose/rate/seed continuation at this scope. After delivery/cleanup, choose and preregister a distinct complete-reply objective or mechanism; an episode-bottleneck objective is a hypothesis, not yet implemented or registered. The count remains1/3 even if renamed. Closed ordinary24/96 and protected constructor/attribution/solver lines remain closed.\n\nThe saved145 resume-profile source is **archived, not activated**: patch+INDEX reproduce producer fdc3dfa8a from eb6f1c32d. Active crate files equal current main. Actual changed-source optimized build,12focusedtests and source review PASS at fdc3dfa8a; model exited0 and sealed. Final delivery-head checks cover unchanged active source, exact patch reconstruction/applicability, evidence hashes, formatting/claim wording and independent review. No redundant full-suite claim or transport-check substitution.\n\n[Canonical record](docs/labs/m2-cross-145-2026-10-10/README.md) records complete protocol,exact gains/losses,identities,costs,limits and Next. Candidate field5adb9df8e61f198ea3d10696f091562780f68e6db0f41947df7e015a61dae60c; reportbe3399c6321144453b7ba055f56aefa42973447fe739ecd8e9d54da248034078. Independent reader verifies1,024 endpoint rows,prior-prefix chains,frozen membership,restoration,schedule,early145 and native26,159code changes.\n\nModel process750.582s,peakRSS785,356KiB,sampledGPU824MiB. Complete-cycle preparation/build/review/preservation/delivery/cleanup is charged at closeout. No model/setup failure; this is a measured negative. Main package92,989,440bytes,MD5 9da98b40298f3c20e6a4de5c506e4334,fulliCloudreadback/indexverified; includes rejectedrun/runtime/sourcepatch/bundle and accepted145+upstream lineage. No local archive staging.\n\n- [x] Final exact delivery-head checks and review posted before queueing.\n- [x] Actual producer12tests/build/source review and model/saved-evidence review PASS.\n- [x] Negative source patch+INDEX; active model code unchanged.\n- [x] Canonical record/current-state,STATUS/ROADMAP Next updated.\n- [x] Preserved full result/parent lineage with verified readback/index.\n- [x] Fresh-main merge/tree verification,branch/worktree deletion,hygiene,pod/cost closure.\n\nReferences #2030. M2 target256 thenfresh40% remains unmet; exposeddevelopment only,not a general ceiling/chat/geometry/energy claim. A result ends this cycle,not the standing goal.\n",
